{title: Chahiye Thoda Pyar}
{artist: Kishore Kumar Bappi Lahiri}
{key: Fm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Fm] Chahiye thoda py [C] aar,        thoda p [Eb] yar chahiye
[Fm] Jaaneman gul [Eb] badan,        meri baat maa [Fm] niye
Chahiye thoda pyaar,        thoda pyaar chahiye
[Fm] Chori chhuppe pyar,        kabhi hona chahi [Eb] ye
[A#] Rutt ho jawan phir to,        humein khona chaa [Fm] hiye
[Fm] Jai kaali kalkatte wali,        tera vachan na jaye khali
[Fm] Bachha loag bajao taali,        Chahiye thoda pyaar
thoda pyaar chahiye,        jaane man gulbadan
meri baat maaniye,        Chahiye thoda pyaar
thoda pyaar chahiye,        Koi haseen kar na
sakaa meraa saamanaa,        Merii nazar jaadu bhari
dil ko thaamanaa,        Jai kaali kalakatte vaali
teraa vachan na jaae khaali,        Chhokarii log are bajaao taalii
Chahiye thoda pyaar
